.lattice/story/actives/B-8b69/review-runs.json:15:      "assembledPrompt": "## Runtime Contract\n\nLifecycle: INIT -> INIT_CHECK -> PLAN -> DEV -> REVIEW -> TEST -> DONE.\nOnly the Story owner/implementer writes implementation; independent reviewers write signed findings or passes.\nStory and fixture facts use Lattice CLI paths; gate evidence is structured and fail-closed.\nNever fabricate host, human, provider, receipt, or Authority evidence.\n\n## Role Contract\n\n{\"allowedCommandIds\":[\"review_run_start\",\"finding_add\",\"review_pass_set\"],\"defaultDispatch\":true,\"forbiddenActionIds\":[\"fabricate-authority\",\"write-outside-role-boundary\"],\"renderDigest\":\"1400d1ed9c57c2ae45e7bb007a687cfa4b0a87a0badb77f929fb007ea0b7b1e3\",\"requiredCheckIds\":[\"scope-and-authority-check\"],\"requiredInputIds\":[\"dispatch-target\",\"project-runtime-guide\"],\"requiredOutputIds\":[\"review-finding-or-pass\"],\"responsibility\":\"Review implementation quality, safety, and maintainability.\",\"roleId\":\"lattice-review-quality\",\"schemaVersion\":\"proofbound.role-contract.v1\",\"semanticDigest\":\"ea63f5812defd28c23b8f6b9bdbcd058ac25cad6569484a85a15614e26a346f0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"stopConditionCodes\":[\"missing-required-input\",\"authority-boundary\"]}\n\n## Task Context\n\n{\"checklist\":[{\"context\":\"New backward edge PLAN->INIT guarded by canReopenToInit (owner-gated, requires a reason, allowed only pre-REVIEW from PLAN). Wire it into BOTH the xstate machine states and canSendStoryEventWithoutSnapshotCan so story_advance --phase=INIT from PLAN lands at INIT, the only phase where title/context is editable.\",\"files\":{\"create\":[],\"modify\":[\"packages/main/src/cli/command-catalog.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/lifecycle-registry.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/machine.ts\",\"packages/main/src/handlers/story-advance.ts\",\"packages/main/src/handlers/transition-orchestrator.ts\"],\"test\":[]},\"id\":\"CHK-001\",\"relatedDocs\":[],\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Add a gated PLAN->INIT reopen transition to the story state machine\",\"userSees\":\"Running lattice story_advance {storyId:B-x,phase:INIT,reason:...} from a PLAN worktree prints: Story B-x advanced to INIT. Omitting reason prints a clear refusal; reopening from any non-PLAN phase is refused.\",\"verificationIntent\":{\"adversarial\":[{\"desc\":\"reopen is refused when reason is missing, and refused from any non-PLAN phase such as DEV or REVIEW\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:adversarial:0\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"edge\":[{\"desc\":\"after reopening to INIT, checklist_update of the title succeeds because title/context is editable at INIT\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:edge:0\",\"priority\":\"should\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"happy\":[{\"desc\":\"story_advance phase=INIT from a PLAN worktree with a reason lands the story at INIT\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:happy:0\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}]}},{\"context\":\"In worktree.ts dev_start, resolve the existing worktree path and storyRel against the MAIN repo root (git --git-common-dir) rather than --show-toplevel, so the reuse early-return fires and the branch-content guard stops seeing a .worktrees/<id>/-prefixed path. Required so re-advance INIT->INIT_CHECK from inside the worktree reuses rather than re-bootstraps.\",\"files\":{\"create\":[],\"modify\":[\"packages/main/src/handlers/worktree.ts\"],\"test\":[]},\"id\":\"CHK-002\",\"relatedDocs\":[\".lattice/story/actives/B-8b69/background.md\"],\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Fix dev_start so a bounce from inside the worktree reuses the existing worktree instead of false-failing\",\"userSees\":\"Re-advancing lattice story_advance phase=INIT_CHECK from inside the existing worktree prints: Story B-x advanced to INIT_CHECK reusing the worktree, instead of: Branch story/B-x already exists but does not contain .worktrees/...\",\"verificationIntent\":{\"adversarial\":[{\"desc\":\"when the worktree directory was deleted, dev_start re-bootstraps cleanly without the .worktrees-prefixed branch-content false-fail\",\"id\":\"CHK-002:adversarial:0\",\"priority\":\"should\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"edge\":[{\"desc\":\"dev_start invoked from the main repo root still resolves and reuses the worktree byte-identically\",\"id\":\"CHK-002:edge:0\",\"priority\":\"should\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"happy\":[{\"desc\":\"re-advance INIT->INIT_CHECK from inside the existing worktree reuses it and does not emit the does-not-contain .worktrees false-fail\",\"id\":\"CHK-002:happy:0\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}]}},{\"context\":\"checklist.ts tells the user to story_advance back to INIT_CHECK to change title/context, but INIT_CHECK stays in titleContextProtectedPhases so title is still frozen there; only INIT allows edits. Update the guidance text to name the reopen-to-INIT path. Keep INIT_CHECK protected (no invariant change).\",\"files\":{\"create\":[],\"modify\":[\"packages/main/src/handlers/checklist.ts\"],\"test\":[]},\"id\":\"CHK-003\",\"relatedDocs\":[\".lattice/story/actives/B-8b69/background.md\"],\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Correct the contradictory title-freeze guidance to point at reopen-to-INIT\",\"userSees\":\"Attempting checklist_update of a title at PLAN prints a refusal that tells the user to story_advance --phase=INIT (not INIT_CHECK) to change title/context.\",\"verificationIntent\":{\"adversarial\":[{\"desc\":\"title/context edits remain rejected at INIT_CHECK so the scope-freeze invariant is preserved\",\"id\":\"CHK-003:adversarial:0\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"edge\":[{\"desc\":\"the refusal text no longer instructs the user to go back to INIT_CHECK\",\"id\":\"CHK-003:edge:0\",\"priority\":\"should\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"happy\":[{\"desc\":\"checklist_update of a title at PLAN prints a refusal that names story_advance --phase=INIT (reopen-to-INIT), not INIT_CHECK\",\"id\":\"CHK-003:happy:0\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}]}},{\"context\":\"Permanent smoke: story -> INIT_CHECK -> PLAN (commands run from inside 