he existing worktree, correct the contradictory checklist guidance, and add a round-trip smoke that reopens->edits a title->re-reviews->re-advances entirely from inside the worktree with no manual git surgery.\",\"headHash\":\"6af18f59e122b7bbdb0d620b86a9e729bb3da808\",\"materialHash\":\"afe1f97f2259ef2dfd0c53b48dd82e4aeb463b6267211d3537f393561fa31a18\",\"phase\":\"REVIEW\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"schemaVersion\":\"proofbound.full-task-context.v1\",\"scope\":{\"allowedCreate\":[\"packages/main/src/tasks/plan-init-reopen-roundtrip-smoke.ts\"],\"allowedModify\":[\"packages/main/src/cli/command-catalog.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/lifecycle-registry.ts\",\"packages/main/src/core/machine.ts\",\"packages/main/src/handlers/checklist.ts\",\"packages/main/src/handlers/story-advance.ts\",\"packages/main/src/handlers/transition-orchestrator.ts\",\"packages/main/src/handlers/worktree.ts\"],\"allowedTest\":[\"packages/main/src/tasks/plan-init-reopen-roundtrip-smoke.ts\"],\"explicitExcludes\":[],\"fileRules\":[],\"mode\":\"enforce\",\"pathCanonicalizationMode\":\"enforce\",\"pathCanonicalizerVersion\":\"repo-relative-v1\",\"protectedAnchors\":[],\"protectedFiles\":[]},\"scopeContractDigest\":\"3aef95fe1a7cfd9a6a74aa48459bac5956fbec453d06127d4f39acdb1c8d492e\",\"storyFilesHash\":\"fb1cb01057571e96a260312461bf427417314732ce4319d722088fafd3b760c5\",\"storyId\":\"B-8b69\",\"title\":\"Add gated PLAN->INIT reopen so a scope-flagged frozen title on a worktree story can be fixed\"}\n\n## Known Execution Environment\n\n{\"architecture\":\"arm64\",\"cliVersion\":\"0.3.237\",\"nodeVersion\":\"v22.13.0\",\"platform\":\"darwin\",\"schemaVersion\":\"proofbound.known-execution-environment.v1\",\"source\":\"trusted-local-runtime\"}\n\n## Dispatch Prompt\n\nAs lattice-review-quality, review story B-8b69 using the trusted context selected by review_run_start.\n\nWorking directory (subagent must cd here): /Users/jek/Documents/Work/proofbound/.worktrees/B-8b69\n\nExecution rhythm / liveness:\n- Af