ed PLAN->INIT reopen transition to the story state machine\",\"userSees\":\"Running lattice story_advance {storyId:B-x,phase:INIT,reason:...} from a PLAN worktree prints: Story B-x advanced to INIT. Omitting reason prints a clear refusal; reopening from any non-PLAN phase is refused.\",\"verificationIntent\":{\"adversarial\":[{\"desc\":\"reopen is refused when reason is missing, and refused from any non-PLAN phase such as DEV or REVIEW\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:adversarial:0\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"edge\":[{\"desc\":\"after reopening to INIT, checklist_update of the title succeeds because title/context is editable at INIT\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:edge:0\",\"priority\":\"should\",\"type\":\"cli\"}],\"happy\":[{\"desc\":\"story_advance phase=INIT from a PLAN worktree with a reason lands the story at INIT\",\"id\":\"CHK-001:happy:0\",\"priority\":\"must\",\"type\":\"cli\"}]}},{\"context\":\"In worktree.ts dev_start, resolve the existing worktree path and storyRel against the MAIN repo root (git --git-common-dir) rather than --show-toplevel, so the reuse early-return fires and the branch-content guard stops seeing a .worktrees/<id>/-prefixed path. Required so re-advance INIT->INIT_CHECK from inside the worktree reuses rather than re-bootstraps.\",\"files\":{\"create\":[],\"modify\":[\"packages/main/src/handlers/worktree.ts\"],\"test\":[]},\"id\":\"CHK-002\",\"relatedDocs\":[\".lattice/story/actives/B-8b69/background.md\"],\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Fix dev_start so a bounce from inside the worktree reuses the existing worktree instead of false-failing\",\"userSees\":\"Re-advancing lattice story_advance phase=INIT_CHECK from inside the existing worktree prints: Story B-x advanced to INIT_CHECK reusing the worktree, instead of: Branch story/B-x already exists but does not contain .worktrees/...\",\"verificationIntent\":{\"adversarial\":[{\"desc\":\"when the worktree directory was deleted, dev_start re-bootstraps cleanly without the .worktrees-prefixed branch-